        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Blocklisting.BlocklistService.Handle(NzbDrone.Core.Download.DownloadFailedEvent)"
        ],
        "id": "R3",
        "text": "The torrent info hash is the tracked download's download id when the tracked download uses the torrent protocol. Otherwise it comes from the event data key \"torrentInfoHash\"."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Blocklisting.BlocklistService.Handle(NzbDrone.Core.Download.DownloadFailedEvent)"
        ],
        "id": "R4",
        "text": "Indexer flags are set only when the event data \"indexerFlags\" value parses (case-insensitive) as an indexer flags value. Release type is set only when \"releaseType\" parses as a release type."
